cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mango-disease-ai: A Python Toolkit for Mango Disease Diagnosis"
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python toolkit for Amropali mango fruit disease classification.
  It combines the AA-ENet model (EfficientNet-B0 + CBAM + Transformer encoder),
  CLIP-based mango image validation, Grad-CAM++ explanations, disease symptoms and
  remedies, PDF report generation, a FastAPI REST API and the AmropaliNet Streamlit
  web application.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-11-04"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Arpon-30/UI-Changes-Mango"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/mango-disease-ai/"
keywords:
  - mango disease classification
  - deep learning
  - CNN
  - Transformer
  - explainable AI
  - Grad-CAM++
  - Streamlit
  - agriculture
